<title>USA: Snohomish Cty, Wash. $1.130 mln won by Seafirst.</title>
<headline>Snohomish Cty, Wash. $1.130 mln won by Seafirst.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle First Bank said it won $1.130 million of Snohomish Cty, Wash., limited tax general obligation bonds, 1997 Series B, with a true interest cost of 6.0261 percent.</p>
</text>
